  <p id="c-liangshu-041-wangcheng-chuxiang-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-041-wangcheng-chuxiang-context:p001:m0000" ref="jyx_72x_8t2_AAA">褚翔</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-041-wangcheng-chuxiang-context:p001:m0003" ref="jyx_72x_8t2_AAA">世舉</persName>，河南陽翟人。曾祖<persName id="c-liangshu-041-wangcheng-chuxiang-context:p001:m0014" ref="jyx_72x_8t2">淵</persName>，齊太宰文簡公，佐命齊室。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-041-wangcheng-chuxiang-context:p001:m0029" ref="jyx_72x_8t2_A">蓁</persName>，太常穆子。父<persName id="c-liangshu-041-wangcheng-chuxiang-context:p001:m0037" ref="jyx_72x_8t2_AA">向</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-041-wangcheng-chuxiang-context:p001:m0040" ref="jyx_72x_8t2_AA">景政</persName>。</p>
</text>
